{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30613","headline":"和主司王起 · 戈牢","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣乾文德最称贤，自古儒生少比肩。\n再啓龙门将二纪，两司莺谷已三年。\n蓬山皆美成荣贵，金榜谁知忝後先。\n正是感恩流涕日，但思旌斾碧峰前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戈牢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}